# --- Backends this workspace does not enable. build.rs sets GGML_OPENCL=OFF,
#     GGML_WEBGPU=OFF and GGML_HIP=OFF; ggml-et is an out-of-tree accelerator.
#     TURNING ANY OF THESE ON MEANS DELETING ITS LINE HERE FIRST — the missing
#     sources are exactly what would break the configure, the way Metal did.
ggml/src/ggml-opencl/kernels/*.cl
ggml/src/ggml-webgpu/wgsl-shaders/*.tmpl
ggml/src/ggml-et/et-kernels/src/*

